<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling weakens against dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened slightly against the dollar on tightened dollar supply but strengthened against the pound sterling, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said the shilling traded at a commercial bank mean rate of 614.7900 to the dollar compared with 613.3050 on Monday and at 1005.1848 to the pound compared with 1007.6632 on Monday.</p>
</text>
